WEBVTT

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
During an industrial emergency, the people change faster than the situation does.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.500
Shifts rotate. Responders hand over. Agent processes restart.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:20.000
What gets lost isn't the incident description - it's the consequence of what was already tried.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.600
Incident INC-2026-0817 - smoke near Machine 7. Critical, in containment.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.600
Pressure is rising on the Machine 8 header.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:32.600
Main power is still live.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:38.600
Every observation is a durable row in CockroachDB - not a message in a context window.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:42.800
Here's the reasonable thing to do: restart Machine 7 to clear the fault.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Sentinel embeds that proposal and searches CockroachDB's distributed vector index.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:56.200
Eighteen memories searched, in milliseconds.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:03.400
Each row carries the action taken, the outcome it produced, and the lesson recorded.

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:08.000
That is the difference between remembering a conversation and remembering a consequence.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:12.200
The closest match: INC-2025-0412. Same machine, same situation.

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:15.200
Someone restarted Machine 7 before isolating the shared pressure line.

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:18.800
Pressure transferred to Machine 8. Secondary valve destroyed. Eleven-hour shutdown.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:20.500
So Sentinel recommends the safer sequence instead - and cites the memory it came from.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:24.000
A human approves. Sentinel never touches the machine - a person does.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:31.000
Decision, recommendation status, incident state and audit event - one CockroachDB transaction.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:36.000
Now the part that usually breaks everything.

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:40.000
The primary agent is gone. The backup has zero context.

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:44.000
Except the incident was never stored in the agent.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:52.500
Sentinel rebuilds it from CockroachDB: what happened, what was attempted...

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:59.000
...what must not be repeated, current risks, and the next step.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:03.000
Every step is auditable - retrieval, warning, recommendation, approval, handoff.

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:12.000
All reconstructed from durable memory events in CockroachDB.

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:26.000
The same retrieval is searchable directly - similarity, latency, and which index served it.

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:33.200
CockroachDB is the system of record. Amazon Bedrock reasons over what memory returns.

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:36.000
Normal agents remember conversations.

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:40.500
Sentinel remembers consequences.
